              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>The provided data contains Adobe Illustrator (.ai) files for conceptualizing marram grass sediment-growth feedback and experimental setup. The data further holds all information on plant and soil variables measured in the field and R-scripts used to analyze the establishment and resilience of marram grass and produce the figures for the publication by Höfer et al. in Oecologia:</p>\n<ul<li>Fig.1 - MS_Fig.1_a.ai; MS_Fig.1_b.ai</li>\n<li>Fig.2 - D,T,C_T0_T161.xlsx</li>\n<li>Fig.3 - D,T,C_T0_T161.xlsx</li>\n<li>Fig.4 -  R_calc_RC_T161.T0.xlsx; Stick Sedimentation all Treatments 2021.xlsx; sedi.T.filled.D.xlsx</li>\n<li>Fig.S4 - dGPS Plots x_y.csv; dGPS_D_Plots_21_wgs.csv</li>\n</ul>"
                },
                "dsDescriptionDate": {
